 "summary": "A general-purpose PNP bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, complement to the NPN S9013. It stands off -25 V collector to emitter and -40 V collector to base, carries -500 mA of collector current and dissipates 300 mW at 25 °C ambient. DC gain at -50 mA is 120 to 400, sold in ranks L (120-200), H (200-350) and J (300-400); the 200-350 range is rank H.",
