 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Marking",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The top of the part carries the code 2T1. A solid dot under the code means green molding compound."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Gain ranks",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The hFE limits of 120 to 400 at -50 mA span all three ranks: L is 120 to 200, H is 200 to 350 and J is 300 to 400."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Features",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The part offers high collector current and good hFE linearity, and pairs with the NPN S9013 as its complement."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Power derating",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Allowed collector dissipation is 300 mW up to 25 °C ambient and falls in a straight line to zero at 150 °C."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Packing",
   "page": 4,
   "text": "The standard option is 3,000 parts on a 7-inch (17.8 cm) reel. The carrier tape is static-dissipative carbon-filled polycarbonate, sealed with a heat-activated multilayer polyester cover tape carrying an anti-static coating. The reel is clear polystyrene, anti-static coated."
  }
 ],
